## Model card

- **Name:** Grok 4.7
- **Short description:** SpaceXAI/xAI flagship model for code and everything else, released 2026-09-21 (successor to 4.6 on a new, larger base; knowledge cutoff May 2026).
- **Provider / access:** xAI API (`grok-4-7`), Grok in X, SuperGrok; us-east-1, us-west-2, us-central-1. Text/image in; text out. Reasoning low/medium/high/xhigh. Web/X search, tool calling.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-09-21 (per docs site) (or Sept 22 per VentureBeat release of 4.6 tied with MiMo; 4.7 released Sept 21 per docs). Knowledge cutoff May 2026 (from xAI docs for Grok 4.7).
- **IDs:** `grok-4.7` (xAI)
- **Context window:** 500,000 tokens; long context rates at ≥200K.
- **Modalities:** text, image → text (no audio/video).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** standard rate $2.00 input / $6.00 output per 1M (<200K); $4.00 / $12.00 (≥200K). Cached $0.50 / $1.00. Batch API not supported. Regional US data residency +10% for two regions.
- **Architecture:** New, larger dense foundation than 4.6 (pretrained model size not public); prompted as flagship.

